<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1236"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:hackenmaster@cox.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Wichitan<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, October 15, 2004 - 8:15 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This is my theory, I will let you all pick away at it all you like.  I feel that BTK incident was in direct relation to this event. <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.kake.com/home/headlines/1068336.html" target=_top>http://www.kake.com/home/headlines/1068336.html</a> <BR> <BR>I will not give anymore info than this, as it is my theory.  And don&#39;t wish to slander anyone. <BR> <BR>wichitan <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1236-->
<!--Post: 1329--><!--Time: 1099270008-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1329"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Oliver<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Oliver<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, October 31, 2004 - 4:46 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I are you saying that he was going to permanently retire, but this incident made him change his mind?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1329-->
<!--Post: 1402--><!--Time: 1099978139-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1402"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Esau<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Esau<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, November 08, 2004 - 9:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m wondering if he lives somewhere far from Wichita. If the tape of his phone call to the police was played very often in the news media in the 1970s his voice would almost have to have been recognized by a relative, coworker, neighbor, barber, etc. if he lived in the Wichita area. I would think he attended the university and moved away after his education was completed and goes to Wichita in his spare time. That might explain his familiarity with Wichita without having to live there and maybe explain why his voice has never been identified by the people of Wichita.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 1402-->
<!--Post: 2215--><!--Time: 1103419848-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2215"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jeffnem<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jeffnem<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 18, 2004 - 5:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Not to be rude Wichitan, but I really don&#39;t see at all what this has to do with BTK coming back around. Could you possibly ellaborate?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2215-->
<!--Post: 2220--><!--Time: 1103424981-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2220"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tornado<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tornado<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, December 18, 2004 - 6:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Curious here...are you implying that this could possibly have been BTK&#39;s son or a relative of his, hence the fact that he is now reaping what he has sown in a strange sort of way?...and that he now wants to come clean and so he is sending and planting his crime evidence?  UMMMM...I don&#39;t think so, I see no possible relation between this and BTK...sowwwy.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 2220-->
