<!--Post: 2370--><!--Time: 1103577874-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2370"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Juno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Juno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, December 20, 2004 - 1:24 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->obey? <BR> <BR>I was looking more at the call letters fist, and saw one with CORD in it.  Then with the initials thing one has OBEY in it. Initials Being TKB?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
