<!--/Post: 2424-->
<!--Post: 2451--><!--Time: 1103691601-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST2451"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, December 21, 2004 - 9:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->My post was perhaps not complete agreement, but it was polite. I&#39;d appreciate the same. If I&#39;m not following, why not help me follow? <BR> <BR>Was I incorrect in following along what Juno wrote? <BR> <BR>You can tell plenty without actually mentioning the party in question. Why don&#39;t you try? So far there&#39;s very little for anyone else to follow - but I&#39;ll try. <BR> <BR>Is there more not posted in this particular thread? <BR> <BR>htx.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
